# Copy to activity/.env and fill in. .env is gitignored.
#
# The Discord application id, from Developer Portal -> your app -> General
# Information. It is a public identifier, not a secret: it ships inside the
# built JavaScript and every client that launches the Activity sees it. It is
# kept out of the repo anyway, so the tree carries nothing tied to one
# particular Discord application.
#
# There is deliberately no client secret here. This Activity does no OAuth and
# runs no backend; it calls ready() and nothing more. If a future phase needs a
# secret, it needs a server to hold it, and it does not belong in this file.
VITE_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=
